#Screens
screen.COLORS_SCREEN=颜色
screen.COLORS_SCREEN.comment=更改各种颜色选项，例如伽马或水体颜色。

screen.WATERC_SCREEN=水体颜色
screen.LIGHTINGC_SCREEN=光照颜色

screen.DOF_SCREEN=景深
screen.DOF_SCREEN.comment=调整景深相关设置。

screen.SKY_SCREEN=天空与光照
screen.SKY_SCREEN.comment=包含天空相关选项，例如体积光、镜头光晕和云层。

screen.SHADOWS_SCREEN=阴影
screen.SHADOWS_SCREEN.comment=更改阴影相关设置，如分辨率与视距。

screen.FOG_SCREEN=雾气选项
screen.FOG_SCREEN.comment=包含所有与雾气相关的选项。

screen.NORMALMAP_SCREEN=法线贴图
screen.NORMALMAP_SCREEN.comment=若资源包支持，则启用凹凸或视差贴图支持。

screen.WAVING_SCREEN=摆动物体
screen.WAVING_SCREEN.comment=包含草、小麦、树叶等。

screen.EMISSIVE_SCREEN=自发光
screen.EMISSIVE_SCREEN.comment=更改发光方块（如火把）的光照颜色。
option.emissive_R=红
option.emissive_G=绿
option.emissive_B=蓝
option.minlight=最小光照

screen.REFLECTIONS_SCREEN=反射
screen.REFLECTIONS_SCREEN.comment=切换各种反射效果并调整其质量。

screen.SHADING_SCREEN=卡通渲染
screen.SHADING_SCREEN.comment=切换卡通渲染并调整相关设置。

screen.ADVANCED_SCREEN=高级设置
screen.ADVANCED_SCREEN.comment=还有更多设置可供调整！
